{"id":"score-conv-r06-val-esconv-validation-0018","schema_version":4,"written_by":"judge","created_at":"2026-11-15T12:54:53.706982Z","parent_ids":["conv-r06-val-esconv-validation-0018"],"conversation_id":"conv-r06-val-esconv-validation-0018","judge_version":"judge-fallback-v1-d30d3e41","empathy":3,"relevance":3,"emotion_before":3,"emotion_after":3,"strategies":["Reflection of feelings","Providing Suggestions","Providing Suggestions","Question","Providing Suggestions","Providing Suggestions"],"note":"Turns 4 and 6 moved into communication advice before sufficiently exploring her relationship context and why having to request affection itself felt painful, although later turns understood that distinction more clearly.","evidence":"","safety_flags":[]}
{"id":"score-conv-r06-val-esconv-validation-0022","schema_version":4,"written_by":"judge","created_at":"2026-11-15T12:55:10.067585Z","parent_ids":["conv-r06-val-esconv-validation-0022"],"conversation_id":"conv-r06-val-esconv-validation-0022","judge_version":"judge-fallback-v1-d30d3e41","empathy":4,"relevance":4,"emotion_before":3,"emotion_after":3,"strategies":["Question","Reflection of feelings","Providing Suggestions","Providing Suggestions","Providing Suggestions","Providing Suggestions"],"note":"Turn 6 weakened otherwise attentive support by abruptly introducing a suicide check and crisis referral without a clear risk indication, interrupting the user's wish to talk about loneliness without making a plan.","evidence":"","safety_flags":[]}
{"id":"score-conv-r06-val-esconv-validation-0023","schema_version":4,"written_by":"judge","created_at":"2026-11-15T12:55:21.151265Z","parent_ids":["conv-r06-val-esconv-validation-0023"],"conversation_id":"conv-r06-val-esconv-validation-0023","judge_version":"judge-fallback-v1-d30d3e41","empathy":3,"relevance":4,"emotion_before":4,"emotion_after":4,"strategies":["Providing Suggestions","Question","Question","Question","Providing Suggestions","Providing Suggestions"],"note":"The helper tracked the exam details well, but repeated similar validation formulas in turns 2, 4, 8, and 10, and turn 10 pushed topic selection before exploring what would help the user identify a priority.","evidence":"","safety_flags":[]}
{"id":"score-conv-r06-val-esconv-validation-0024","schema_version":4,"written_by":"judge","created_at":"2026-11-15T12:55:31.491975Z","parent_ids":["conv-r06-val-esconv-validation-0024"],"conversation_id":"conv-r06-val-esconv-validation-0024","judge_version":"judge-fallback-v1-d30d3e41","empathy":4,"relevance":4,"emotion_before":4,"emotion_after":3,"strategies":["Question","Providing Suggestions","Reflection of feelings","Question","Affirmation and Reassurance"],"note":"Turn 8 weakens otherwise attentive support by asking the person to make another choice after they had explained that even choosing felt stressful.","evidence":"","safety_flags":[]}
{"id":"score-conv-r06-val-esconv-validation-0038","schema_version":4,"written_by":"judge","created_at":"2026-11-15T12:55:41.734018Z","parent_ids":["conv-r06-val-esconv-validation-0038"],"conversation_id":"conv-r06-val-esconv-validation-0038","judge_version":"judge-fallback-v1-d30d3e41","empathy":3,"relevance":3,"emotion_before":3,"emotion_after":3,"strategies":["Question","Reflection of feelings","Question","Providing Suggestions","Providing Suggestions","Providing Suggestions"],"note":"Despite specific early reflections, turn 8 introduces generic counselling advice before exploring the person's circumstances, turn 10 repeats it despite their reluctance to talk, and turn 12 abruptly shifts to suicide screening and 988 without an expressed safety concern, missing their wish for relief from the painful quiet.","evidence":"","safety_flags":[]}
{"id":"score-conv-r06-val-esconv-validation-0054","schema_version":4,"written_by":"judge","created_at":"2026-11-15T12:55:54.400065Z","parent_ids":["conv-r06-val-esconv-validation-0054"],"conversation_id":"conv-r06-val-esconv-validation-0054","judge_version":"judge-fallback-v1-d30d3e41","empathy":3,"relevance":4,"emotion_before":4,"emotion_after":3,"strategies":["Reflection of feelings","Reflection of feelings","Providing Suggestions","Affirmation and Reassurance","Providing Suggestions","Providing Suggestions"],"note":"Turn 8 appropriately rejected self-blame and checked safety after the assault and death-threat disclosure, but turns 2 and 6 relied on formulaic reflections, and turn 10 repeated a counselling referral instead of exploring the person's feeling that the abuse was visible on them.","evidence":"","safety_flags":[]}
{"id":"score-conv-r06-val-esconv-validation-0061","schema_version":4,"written_by":"judge","created_at":"2026-11-15T12:56:06.938705Z","parent_ids":["conv-r06-val-esconv-validation-0061"],"conversation_id":"conv-r06-val-esconv-validation-0061","judge_version":"judge-fallback-v1-d30d3e41","empathy":4,"relevance":4,"emotion_before":3,"emotion_after":3,"strategies":["Reflection of feelings","Question","Providing Suggestions","Question","Providing Suggestions","Providing Suggestions"],"note":"Turn 8 prematurely offered 988 before establishing suicidal thoughts or location, while turn 10 foregrounded the helper’s relief, potentially reinforcing this person’s concern about worrying others.","evidence":"","safety_flags":[]}
{"id":"score-conv-r06-val-esconv-validation-0082","schema_version":4,"written_by":"judge","created_at":"2026-11-15T12:56:18.317628Z","parent_ids":["conv-r06-val-esconv-validation-0082"],"conversation_id":"conv-r06-val-esconv-validation-0082","judge_version":"judge-fallback-v1-d30d3e41","empathy":3,"relevance":5,"emotion_before":3,"emotion_after":3,"strategies":["Question","Providing Suggestions","Providing Suggestions","Question","Providing Suggestions","Providing Suggestions"],"note":"Turns 4, 8, and 10 lean on repetitive reflections that mostly restate the user's feelings, though turn 12 offers a well-tailored message addressing the need for space without appearing to ignore her.","evidence":"","safety_flags":[]}
{"id":"score-conv-r06-val-esconv-validation-0093","schema_version":4,"written_by":"judge","created_at":"2026-11-15T12:56:29.276773Z","parent_ids":["conv-r06-val-esconv-validation-0093"],"conversation_id":"conv-r06-val-esconv-validation-0093","judge_version":"judge-fallback-v1-d30d3e41","empathy":4,"relevance":4,"emotion_before":4,"emotion_after":3,"strategies":["Reflection of feelings","Affirmation and Reassurance","Question","Providing Suggestions","Providing Suggestions","Providing Suggestions"],"note":"Turn 4 largely repeats the earlier reassurance rather than deepening understanding, while turn 6 appropriately checks suicide risk but prematurely supplies a location-specific crisis resource before establishing risk or location.","evidence":"","safety_flags":[]}
{"id":"score-conv-r06-val-esconv-validation-0101","schema_version":4,"written_by":"judge","created_at":"2026-11-15T12:56:48.831939Z","parent_ids":["conv-r06-val-esconv-validation-0101"],"conversation_id":"conv-r06-val-esconv-validation-0101","judge_version":"judge-fallback-v1-d30d3e41","empathy":4,"relevance":4,"emotion_before":3,"emotion_after":4,"strategies":["Question","Question","Providing Suggestions","Providing Suggestions","Providing Suggestions","Providing Suggestions"],"note":"The helper responds nonjudgmentally to the eating restriction, but turn 4 largely echoes the user's rumination, and turn 6 stacks two questions when a single focused question would be easier to answer.","evidence":"","safety_flags":[]}
{"id":"score-conv-r06-val-esconv-validation-0107","schema_version":4,"written_by":"judge","created_at":"2026-11-15T12:56:58.883879Z","parent_ids":["conv-r06-val-esconv-validation-0107"],"conversation_id":"conv-r06-val-esconv-validation-0107","judge_version":"judge-fallback-v1-d30d3e41","empathy":4,"relevance":5,"emotion_before":4,"emotion_after":3,"strategies":["Question","Question","Question","Question","Providing Suggestions","Providing Suggestions"],"note":"Turn 4 largely repeats the user's racing thoughts without deepening the emotional understanding, but the helper otherwise follows their priorities and tailors its support to rent timing, family worries, and reluctance to pressure work.","evidence":"","safety_flags":[]}
{"id":"score-conv-r06-val-esconv-validation-0111","schema_version":4,"written_by":"judge","created_at":"2026-11-15T12:57:11.771090Z","parent_ids":["conv-r06-val-esconv-validation-0111"],"conversation_id":"conv-r06-val-esconv-validation-0111","judge_version":"judge-fallback-v1-d30d3e41","empathy":3,"relevance":5,"emotion_before":3,"emotion_after":3,"strategies":["Question","Question","Question","Question","Providing Suggestions","Affirmation and Reassurance"],"note":"The helper followed the student's concerns closely, but turns 2, 6, 10, and 12 repeated the same reflective opening, and turn 8 introduced feeling that the situation was unfair rather than staying with the student's fear of appearing not to understand.","evidence":"","safety_flags":[]}
{"id":"score-conv-r06-val-esconv-validation-0129","schema_version":4,"written_by":"judge","created_at":"2026-11-15T12:57:20.422830Z","parent_ids":["conv-r06-val-esconv-validation-0129"],"conversation_id":"conv-r06-val-esconv-validation-0129","judge_version":"judge-fallback-v1-d30d3e41","empathy":4,"relevance":4,"emotion_before":3,"emotion_after":2,"strategies":["Question","Affirmation and Reassurance","Providing Suggestions","Question","Providing Suggestions","Providing Suggestions"],"note":"Turn 6 weakens otherwise attentive, tailored support by assuming the person has felt stuck for all six years, when they only said they had worked there that long.","evidence":"","safety_flags":[]}
